{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937940/extras/eae43997d9544bd71cb4c595d811ce46.avif?t=1761909441\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6Game Overview\u25c6</h2>While on a company trip, the cruise ship you boarded sinks following an unfortunate accident.<br>This leaves you stranded on a deserted island with three of your female coworkers.<br>You must work together to explore the island, gather resources, and survive against the harsh forces of nature.<br><br>You find yourself growing closer with the three women as time passes, leading to unexpected changes...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6Character Introduction\u25c6</h2><br>Akemi<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937940/extras/73d4bdb839aa40eb4c62c9339cda202a.avif?t=1761909441\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><br>Akemi is your senior, an experienced colleague from the sales department.<br>Warm and dependable, she has supported you ever since you first joined the company.<br>You may not need guidance anymore, yet she still checks in, the kind of dependable senior who never lets you feel alone.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937940/extras/fa145c5fe99b8b6b8f17b114221e81f2.avif?t=1761909441\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><br><br>Yumeno<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937940/extras/a9f782da92d9b26c858ad135e1d18d7f.avif?t=1761909441\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><br>Yumeno is a younger colleage who's full of energy. She was part of the track and field team in college and has excellent stamina.<br>She looks up to you and takes the initiative to help out, both when you were at the company, and now on the island.<br>She admires you and is always eager to lend a hand, whether back at the office or here on the island.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937940/extras/2562fcc50435cdc22ed283f98f3f4a94.avif?t=1761909441\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><br><br>Shizuha<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937940/extras/11a17f9f2e865bb55dc82829f68644bb.avif?t=1761909441\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><br>Shizuha is from the administration department and is currently married.<br>Calm, kind, and naturally caring, she has always been someone who keeps things running smoothly.<br>You never talked much back at the office. Yet here on the island, she reveals a quietly dependable strength you never expected.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937940/extras/cb5e38d6a196564045ff08f8ea3e4ac8.avif?t=1761909441\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6Game Features\u25c6</h2><br>\u25c7Survive Together\u25c7<br>Explore the island freely, gather food and water, craft tools and shelter, and build a stable life in the wild.<br>Nature and predators will push your judgment and leadership to the limit.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937940/extras/a0ad534b1acd118fdd1a372f387dc262.avif?t=1761909441\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937940/extras_big/a0ad534b1acd118fdd1a372f387dc262.webp?t=1761909441 width=1560 height=877 /></span><br><br>\u25c7Deepening Bonds\u25c7<br>Interactions evolve as time passes.<br>From reliance to trust to simmering romance, emotions grow\u2026 and conflicts might follow.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937940/extras/a50756bcb3d2c95a1d960780701412a3.avif?t=1761909441\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937940/extras_big/a50756bcb3d2c95a1d960780701412a3.webp?t=1761909441 width=1560 height=877 /></span><br><br>\u25c7Romance &amp; Adult Scenes\u25c7<br>As trust grows, so does intimacy.<br>Between the four of you, friendship, love, or something far more complicated may emerge depending on your actions.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937940/extras/038724ea783208d5d7aad32cb840858f.avif?t=1761909441\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937940/extras_big/038724ea783208d5d7aad32cb840858f.webp?t=1761909441 width=1560 height=877 /></span><br><br>\u25c7Multiple Routes &amp; Endings\u25c7<br>Focus on one partner, balance delicate relationships, or try to have it all. Every decision shapes your fate together.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937940/extras/7734c9d2269aa15bc2a5158090f13296.avif?t=1761909441\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937940/extras_big/7734c9d2269aa15bc2a5158090f13296.webp?t=1761909441 width=1560 height=877 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937940/extras/797d4be35afaae580f641e3c1f5efc43.avif?t=1761909441\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937940/extras_big/797d4be35afaae580f641e3c1f5efc43.webp?t=1761909441 width=1560 height=877 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6Game Systems\u25c6</h2><br>\u25c7Status &amp; Resource Management\u25c7<br>Manage stress, stamina, and affection levels.<br>Water and food are essential resources. Plan exploration, cooking, and storage carefully.<br>Neglecting basic needs may have dire consequences!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937940/extras/40f29e7c93cc1217221328365b210031.avif?t=1761909441\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937940/extras_big/40f29e7c93cc1217221328365b210031.webp?t=1761909441 width=1560 height=877 /></span><br><br>\u25c7Action Planning &amp; Growth\u25c7<br>Choose how to spend each day: explore, craft, cook, or venture out with any coworker you like.<br>As experience grows, so do survival skills, unlocking better tools and abilities for you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937940/extras/ffbb2d828f188f3b1941efdc2c3da39e.avif?t=1761909441\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><br><br>\u25c7Exploration &amp; Combat\u25c7<br>Resources are plentiful, but the island can be unforgiving.<br>Craft weapons, plan your moves carefully, and fight for every chance to survive.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937940/extras/a6d4050e045023f6345c054193ab6b8b.avif?t=1761909441\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937940/extras_big/a6d4050e045023f6345c054193ab6b8b.webp?t=1761909441 width=1560 height=877 /></span><br><br>\u25c7Developing Relationships\u25c7<br>Stress, mood, and physical needs all shape how characters interact.<br>Talk, comfort, and grow closer to unlock unique moments and intimate developments.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937940/extras/478b39975c24c2a835759fd2be5302e6.avif?t=1761909441\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937940/extras_big/478b39975c24c2a835759fd2be5302e6.webp?t=1761909441 width=1560 height=877 /></span><br><br>\ud83d\udd00 Final Choice<br>Your relationships are not the only thing at stake. Will you build a new life on the island, or hold out for rescue?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6Content\u25c6</h2>\u30fb ~44 scenes registered in the Replay Mode<br>\u30fb\u201cUnlock All Replay Scenes\u201d feature (conditions apply)","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2937940?t=1761909441","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2937940?t=1761909441","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937940/07f5b46f237a3475525528eced8226ddca5eba1e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761909441","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937940/07f5b46f237a3475525528eced8226ddca5eba1e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761909441","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"All characters depicted are over the age of 20.\r\nContent Warning! This game depicts: Sex Acts, Death, Suicide, Sex while Pregnant, Exhibitionism, Paizuri, Blowjobs, Voyeurism.\r\n\r\nThis game also features non-realistic, stylized side stories that briefly touch on sensitive topics such as suicide and murder. These scenes are rare, subtle in both visual and narrative presentation, and are not part of the main storyline.\r\n\r\nThe intent behind these depictions is to explore the psychological and emotional struggles of the characters under extreme conditions. They are not intended to promote or romanticize suicide or violence in any way."},"detailed_description":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937940/extras/eae43997d9544bd71cb4c595d811ce46.avif?t=1761909441\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6Game Overview\u25c6</h2>While on a company trip, the cruise ship you boarded sinks following an unfortunate accident.<br>This leaves you stranded on a deserted island with three of your female coworkers.<br>You must work together to explore the island, gather resources, and survive against the harsh forces of nature.<br><br>You find yourself growing closer with the three women as time passes, leading to unexpected changes...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6Character Introduction\u25c6</h2><br>Akemi<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937940/extras/73d4bdb839aa40eb4c62c9339cda202a.avif?t=1761909441\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><br>Akemi is your senior, an experienced colleague from the sales department.<br>Warm and dependable, she has supported you ever since you first joined the company.<br>You may not need guidance anymore, yet she still checks in, the kind of dependable senior who never lets you feel alone.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937940/extras/fa145c5fe99b8b6b8f17b114221e81f2.avif?t=1761909441\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><br><br>Yumeno<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937940/extras/a9f782da92d9b26c858ad135e1d18d7f.avif?t=1761909441\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><br>Yumeno is a younger colleage who's full of energy. She was part of the track and field team in college and has excellent stamina.<br>She looks up to you and takes the initiative to help out, both when you were at the company, and now on the island.<br>She admires you and is always eager to lend a hand, whether back at the office or here on the island.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937940/extras/2562fcc50435cdc22ed283f98f3f4